  "title": "Swiss Steak Quick and Easy",
  "description": "Pounded cube steaks are lightly coated in flour and fried, then cooked with mushrooms, onions, brown gravy, and stewed tomatoes. Serve over a bed of egg noodles or rice with a chunk of thick, crusty bread.",
  "authors": [
    "Helene Rose-Carson"
